  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I dont really like the new 4way puppet for the mirror size, I haven't been able to try on desktop but I can imagine it'll be fine if my controller doesn't drift. But on desktop if I dont have my mouse perfectly centered on the radial puppet, it will move in any direction my mouse is slightly towards.I really liked the old size buttons. I think having an option to toggle between having a puppet slider or buttons would allow everyone to use it how they want.",
